# Rust build output.
# Cargo.lock is COMMITTED on purpose: binary crate — reproducible agent installs.
/target
.DS_Store
/tmp

# Documentation site
/website/node_modules/
/website/build/
/website/.docusaurus/
/docs/reference.md
/docs/reference/
/website/static/search-index.json

# Agent/tool scratch state. `.omc/skills/` is the deliberate exception —
# project-scoped skills are meant to be committed, and git will not descend
# into a wholly-ignored directory, so `.omc/*` + a negation is the only
# spelling that keeps that door open.
/.omc/*
!/.omc/skills/
/.playwright-mcp/

# Gateway backups. Never source: a .gwbk is a full gateway image, routinely
# hundreds of MB, and `ign backup download` drops them in the cwd.
*.gwbk

# Live/UAT probe output written into the repo root by hand-run commands
# (`ign tags export`, `project export`, pterm captures). Root-scoped on
# purpose so a legitimately named file deeper in the tree is not swallowed.
/uat-*
/Uat*
/uattest*
/pterm_*.zip
